  <p class="kicker">Block</p>
  <h1>Report</h1>
  <p class="meta">FLOAT 0.2.0 · beta of {release.date.en}</p>

  <dl class="inshort"><div><dt>What it is</dt><dd>The record of a processing, set out as a short scientific report: what was shot, what was measured, what was done.</dd></div><div><dt>What it shows</dt><dd>The shooting details, the star size and sky of every frame through the night, the figures each block measured, and the settings that were changed.</dd></div><div><dt>What can be exported</dt><dd>The whole report as a PDF or a PNG, the shooting details as text, and any section or night card as a picture.</dd></div></dl>

